@gkalpak since I'm already here, would it make sense to add the polyfills from #20756 as part of this PR? Reminder of your own comment here: https://github.com/angular/angular/issues/20756#issuecomment-386315924

The problem is that some devices are stuck on older Chromium versions and there's no way to update them. This is valid for Smart TVs and also other Smart TV Box type devices and kiosks.

Ref: https://github.com/jakearchibald/async-waituntil-polyfill
